  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/cozy/requires/quilt-standard-libraries_64h.png\" width=\"311\" height=\"64\"></a></p><hr><p>这是一个小型模组，为游戏添加了16款背包，可装备在胸甲槽位。</p><p>它将你的物品栏空间翻倍，并且可以放置在地面上作为装饰！<br><br></p><p><strong>背包与GUI截图一览</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142283955-60842ff4-7ee9-4c7d-ad13-5eee08c6b0ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284019-146ca1d8-ae8d-41a4-b0c5-a0c2e708d030.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284054-911f7586-f9a0-4a12-98f1-f7c98044e7ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284068-394839a8-fbea-4f93-a165-22fa42b98243.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142284075-82b1ada8-fefa-4a1c-9558-dfefb78452e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p></div><p><strong>Q：</strong>请问能让我们把背包放到饰品栏（Trinkets）里吗？</p><p><strong>A：</strong>不行。为一个我不打算实现的功能额外增加工作量太麻烦了。这会让物品栏空间完全免费，毫无成本可言。如果你想要这种功能，去装其他背包模组吧。</p><p><strong>Q：</strong>我该怎么合成背包？</p><p><strong>A：</strong>你可以安装REI查看它们的合成表，但基本格式如下。</p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16853086/142283697-cec75a52-f783-4d0e-97c6-02da74fb23dd.png\" width=\"462\" height=\"210\"></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/f5dFYWX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/discord.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcamellias%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/kofi.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fCammiesCorner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/banner.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"253\"></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>",
